  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Trade and Development: E-Commerce Technical Assistance and Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia&#x2019;s investment in this program supports developing and least developed countries in the Indo-Pacific to implement, and access the benefits of, e-commerce agreements and initiatives. It helps deepen links with regional and global e-commerce and digital trade architecture and supports capacity building, technical assistance and professional development opportunities for women digital entrepreneurs.</narrative>
  </description>
